---
const forYou = [
  "You've got a real target. A selection. A competition. A number that's been just out of reach.",
  "You train, you show up, but the reps stopped moving.",
  "You'll do the Missions and film your form. That's how I find what's breaking and fix it.",
];
---

<section class="section bg-black-2" aria-label="Who this is for">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl">

    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Who It's For</p>
    <h2 class="headline text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
      Before you join, read this
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 text-base text-stone sm:text-lg">
      You can already do clean pull-ups. You're just stuck at your max, and it's been sitting there too long. Doesn't matter if you're stuck at 15 or 30.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-10 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sand">It's for you if:</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
      {forYou.map((item) => (
        <li class="flex gap-3 text-base text-bone">
          <span class="mt-1 flex-shrink-0 text-sand">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span>{item}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <!-- Redirect block -->
    <div class="mt-10 border-l-2 border-white/15 pl-5">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-stone">Not there yet?</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone">
        Can't do 10 clean reps yet? You're not behind. You're just early. Start with my{' '}
        <a href="/why-youre-stuck" class="text-sand underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-sand-dim transition-colors">free mini course</a>,
        {' '}build a solid foundation first, ani come back for the next Batch. By then you'll be ready.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
